{"term": {"label": "信", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-ii", "title": "盡心下", "description": "孟子曰：「不仁哉，梁惠王也！仁者以其所愛及其所不愛，不仁者以其所不愛及其所愛。」\n公孫丑問曰：「何謂也？」\n「梁惠王以土地之故，糜爛其民而戰之，大敗，將復之，恐不能勝，故驅其所愛子弟以殉之，是之謂以其所不愛及其所愛也。」\n孟子曰：「《春秋》無義戰。彼善於此，則有之矣。征者上伐下也，敵國不相征也。」\n孟子曰：「盡信《書》", "occurrences": 8, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "亂", "id": "亂"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "似", "id": "似"}, {"form": "信", "variants": [], "id": "信"}, {"form": "去", "id": "去"}, {"form": "名", "id": "名"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "恐", "id": "恐"}, {"form": "惡", "id": "惡"}, {"form": "愛", "id": "愛"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "絜", "id": "絜"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "道", "id": "道"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.07159836421881, "source": "亂", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 2.7647455447787554, "source": "亂", "target": "恐"}, {"weight": 1.3784511836588647, "source": "亂", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 0.015873349156290163, "source": "國", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 3.2347491740244907, "source": "國", "target": "名"}, {"weight": 1.730671777248217, "source": "國", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.8484548129046001, "source": "國", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 2.8292840659163265, "source": "國", "target": "去"}, {"weight": 1.9819862055291229, "source": "國", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 3.0524276172305362, "source": "絜", "target": "似"}, {"weight": 2.5416019934645457, "source": "絜", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 1.6661332561106457, "source": "恐", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 0.1212338648141164, "source": "人", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.5266989729222809, "source": "人", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 1.6253112615903906, "source": "人", "target": "名"}, {"weight": 0.23901690047049992, "source": "人", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 2.4928118292951136, "source": "去", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 2.359280436670591, "source": "似", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 2.136136885